From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UniFrog CI <ci@unifrog.local>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 00:30:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt FrogUI libretro frontend to UniFrog

Use standard libretro input and the versioned UniFrog content-launch environment request. Read ROM roots, system mappings, theme, and font from the unified configuration; remove SF3000 shared memory, process spawning, temporary logs, and hard-coded multicore paths.
---
 font.c            | 187 +++++------
 frogui_libretro.c | 803 +++++++++++++++++++++-------------------------
 2 files changed, 431 insertions(+), 559 deletions(-)

